					"content": "別客氣嘛，艾琳也已經很厲害了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100903,
					"content": "我還在為練習感到疲勞，這就是不成熟的證明。但總有一天我會征服蒙德所有的木樁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100904,
					"content": "加油，妳一定可以做到的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100905,
					"content": "謝謝…啊，糟了，專注練習，忘了本來要做的事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100906,
					"content": "嗚…可我已經累得動不了了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100907,
					"content": "榮譽騎士，能不能幫我帶個口信給傑克？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100908,
						101100913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100908,
					"content": "傑克是誰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100909
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101100909,
					"content": "傑克是我的朋友，一位新人冒險家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100910,
					"content": "#原本我們約好，今晚一起討論冒險計畫…能麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}轉告他改天見嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100911,
					"content": "我想，他今天應該是在<color=#00E1FFFF>「南風之獅的廟宇」</color>冒險吧，跟史丹利先生一起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100912,
					"content": "那是一位名震蒙德、曾經抵達「燼寂海」的傳說級大冒險家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100917,
					"content": "很久沒去那裡了，我也想再去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100918
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101100918,
					"content": "#啊，那真是太謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100913,
					"content": "傑克在哪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100914
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101100914,
					"content": "傑克今天跟史丹利先生一起去<color=#00E1FFFF>「南風之獅的廟宇」</color>冒險了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
